# No `/gatherings/:eventId` routes

Event narratives and CTAs live on **`/services`** via **`InteractiveEventsSection`** (hero + film strip). There are **no** standalone event detail pages.

When editing **`src/App.tsx`**:

- Do **not** add `<Route path="/gatherings/:eventId" …>` or a dedicated event detail component.
- **`src/pages/EventDetailPage.tsx`** was removed intentionally.
- Contact flows may still use **`/contact?eventId=…`** for context (`ContactPage`).
